I made the changes both in Visustella and your plugin, but unfortunately everything is still shaking... =(

There's one temporary solution that move the pictures outside of the spriteset.
For example:
SceneManager._scene.addChild(SceneManager._scene._spriteset._pictureContainer);
Or just the first picture:
SceneManager._scene.addChild(SceneManager._scene._spriteset._pictureContainer.children[
0
]);
I think I saw some plugin that does similar things for MV, but I don't recall if there's one for MZ.
The problem is the effect will be reset if you open a menu. So you need to run it every time you make a quake effect.
